  "observations": [
    "GameSelfSeatUi.createChildren 0.120 lines3060..3212 creates selectAllBtn, title 全选手牌, and binds onClickAddAll.",
    "checkBtnState 0.87 lines2210..2257 hides both buttons in look-on/replay; requires self seat and cardSelector. Exact select-all condition: (maxCardCnt > 2 and activeHandCardCount < maxCardCnt) or (cardUseType == SkillCardUseType.DISCARD and maxCardCnt >= 0). Comparison/JMP PCs75..92 were inspected to resolve the boolean expression.",
    "onClickAddAll 0.123 lines3260..3283: if maxCardCnt == selectedCardCnt, unSelectedAllCards then return; otherwise traverse current-page hand-card UIs from last to first, retrieve each real hand card by ID, check isActive and call addSelectedCard. No confirmation or network submission occurs here.",
    "CardSelector.addSelectedCard 0.29 lines220..236 skips nil/duplicate cards; at selectedCount == maxCount invokes popFirstCard, then selects/inserts the new card and dispatches change. Normal selector state and limits remain in control.",
    "SelfCardsArea overrides onTouchBegan/onTouchEnded, not onTouchMoved. Inherited CardsArea.onTouchMoved 0.11 lines146..147 is an empty return. SelfCardsArea.onTouchEnded 0.32 lines937..962 scans hit cards back-to-front, dispatches one EVENT_CARD_CLICK and exits.",
    "CardUiNew.onTouchMoved 0.33 lines610..614 only marks isMoved when distance from startPos reaches20; no multi-card selection occurs there.",
    "CardSelector.autoSelect 0.61 lines888..908 first requires minCardCnt == maxCardCnt == 1; this automatic choice is not a batch-selection gesture."
  ],
