  "zhiheng_followup": {
    "official": "Both normal.ZhiHeng and jiexian.JieZhiHeng have minCardCnt1/maxCardCntMAX_NUMBER(10000000); outside GuoZhan getMaxCardCnt returns MAX_NUMBER. Therefore the max>2 and activeHandCardCount<max branch displays selectAllBtn during ordinary self-use Zhiheng.",
    "guozhan": "Their getMaxCardCnt returns seat.getMaxHp in GuoZhan; apply the exact checkBtnState condition rather than claiming unconditional availability.",
    "field_distinction": "checkBtnState tests cardSelector.cardUseType directly. SkillCardSelector ctor inherits NONE and getCardUseType delegates to skill; skill.cardUseType=DISCARD must not be conflated with the raw selector field. Ordinary Zhiheng already satisfies the first display branch.",
    "noname_local": "ui/lbtn/skins/xinsha.js createSelectAllButton additionally requires event.allowChooseAll, rejects complexCard/complexSelect, and requires selectCard upper bound>1. Current standard.zhiheng and refresh.rezhiheng use [1,Infinity] but do not set allowChooseAll; GameEvent.backup transfers this field from skill. The local implementation does not faithfully cover ordinary Zhiheng visibility.",
    "scope": "Static APK and local source inspection only; no gameplay runtime confirmation and no production code edits."
  }
